title: vcvt.s32.f32 (NEON): NaN -> 0, -inf -> INT_MIN, 3e9 -> INT_MAX, -2.5 -> -2, denormal -> 0
ref: A8.8 VCVT (between floating-point and integer, Advanced SIMD) T1 (op = 10); A2.7 FPToFixed() with round_zero = TRUE: FPUnpack() gives a NaN the value 0 and infinities 2^1000000, SatQ() saturates to the 32-bit range

[code]
fbff0007    vcvt.s32.f32 d16, d0
fbff0117    vcvt.s32.f32 d17, d1
fbff0227    vcvt.s32.f32 d18, d2
7047        bx lr

[in]
s0 = 0x7FC00000
s1 = 0xFF800000
s2 = f32:3e9
s3 = f32:-2.5
s4 = 0x00000001
s5 = 0x4EFFFFFF     # 2147483520.0, the largest float below 2^31

[out]
d16 = 0x8000000000000000
d17 = 0xFFFFFFFE7FFFFFFF
d18 = 0x7FFFFF8000000000
